{"channelId":"UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw","row":["DOLMA ANIMAL TRUST",217,"Dolma dog rescue is dedicated to build awareness towards compassion for animals in need of shelter and medical care. Founded in Tibetan refugee settlement Bylakuppe South India. \nThe rescue house operates with few staffs and one veterinarian. It is managed by Dolma and Kalsang. At rescue house, dogs and cats are brought in by kind locals who wish to see them heal from life threatening injuries. Injured animals are brought here for another chance of life. The rescue house was started in order to give comfort and love to the neglected and injured animals. \nDolma believes in  caring for them and hope to build a sustainable facility.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:14.722Z","channelId":"UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2900ca4ac8c630e6f43b6d65fa946a7295fd4784bed149b0c7cee12296ec1a22","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"67087d0ba2903d9c556a98b7a1dc24a58ad95248aaee6820a97ca762e7cc24db"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":217,"raw":"217 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:14.722Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCveGioAjOYn77PZewipe2fw"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"practitioner_self_report","excerpt":"ibetan refugee settlement Bylakupp